  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Actor Mapping - Political &amp; Social Accountability</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Actor Mapping - Political &amp; Social Accountability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I f&#xf6;rberedelserna f&#xf6;r en ny landstrategi i Bangladesh, kommer den     svenska ambassaden i Dhaka bakom kommissionens en kartl&#xe4;ggning av     akt&#xf6;rer inom de f&#xf6;reslagna omr&#xe5;dena f&#xf6;r framtida samarbete. D&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r    har en studie med titeln &quot;Kartl&#xe4;ggning av Agents of Change och        intressenter som arbetar p&#xe5; politisk och social Accountability i      Bangladesh har planerat att utf&#xf6;ras av en oberoende konsult.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the preparations for a new country strategy in Bangladesh, the     Swedish Embassy in Dhaka will commssion a mapping of stakeholders in  the proposed areas for future co-operation. Hence, a study titled     &apos;Mapping of Agents of Change and Stakeholders Working on Political    and Social Accountability in Bangladesh has been planned to be        carried out by an independent consultant.</narrative>
  </description>
